{"title":"1988 AJHSME Problems/Problem 7","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/8/5/5859f26f2aa4e8c9b2ee6568283748d853114665.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2.46\\times 8.163\\times (5.17+4.829)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"226\" height=\"18\" /> is closest to\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/e/1/6e1e21795a63b2fb996f16e401ade587e656f848.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A)}\\ 100 \\qquad \\text{(B)}\\ 200 \\qquad \\text{(C)}\\ 300 \\qquad \\text{(D)}\\ 400 \\qquad \\text{(E)}\\ 500$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"421\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/7/d/b7d2c7ea6767c82ebc619a4ca8abddee36926b71.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2.46 \\times 8.163 \\times (5.17 + 4.829) = 2.46 \\times 8.163 \\times 9.999 \\approx 2.5 \\times 8 \\times 10 = \\boxed{\\textbf{(B)}\\ 200}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"630\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p><p>- GaloisTorrent, edited by j314andrews,\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit secti